 65424                           ;	ZCD Disable bit
 65425                           ;	ZCD = OFF, ZCD module is disabled. ZCD can be enabled by setting the ZCDSEN bit of ZCD
      +                          CON
 65426                           ;	PPSLOCK bit One-Way Set Enable bit
 65427                           ;	PPS1WAY = OFF, PPSLOCKED bit can be set and cleared repeatedly (subject to the unlock 
      +                          sequence)
 65428                           ;	Stack Full/Underflow Reset Enable bit
 65429                           ;	STVREN = ON, Stack full/underflow will cause Reset
 65430                           ;	Low Voltage Programming Enable bit
 65431                           ;	LVP = OFF, HV on MCLR/VPP must be used for programming
 65432                           ;	Extended Instruction Set Enable bit
 65433                           ;	XINST = OFF, Extended Instruction Set and Indexed Addressing Mode disabled
